**Commit:** `d38aac6` on `lane/blog-orphan-purge`

**Files changed (2):**
- `app/blog/page.tsx` ΓÇö removed Plate import and DO-ART-211 section, widened containers from `max-w-4xl` to `max-w-6xl`
- `components/BlogList.tsx` ΓÇö full rewrite: lead post card (newest post, 16:9 artwork left + content right), sticky filter rail with `aria-pressed` + post count, two-column card grid with 16:9 artwork, line-clamp-2 excerpt, cerulean focus-visible rings on all interactive elements

**tsc:** passes clean

**Mockup gaps:**
- The mockup shows artwork as SVG placeholders (`<svg>` placeholders for DO-ART slots). The implementation uses `post.featuredImage` URLs ΓÇö no grey boxes when artwork is missing (posts without `featuredImage` render chip + title + excerpt only, per brief).
- The mockup's `count` uses a monospace font (`var(--do-font-mono)`). I used `var(--do-font-body)` instead to avoid loading an unused font on the marketing surface (consistent with the site's existing approach ΓÇö Decision 03 removes JetBrains Mono from new work).
- The mockup's CTA section uses `<a class="btn-amber">` and `<a class="alt">`. The live page uses a Next.js `<Link>` with inline styles matching the same values ΓÇö no visual difference.
